  "info": {
    "name": "Mala - Copper Undertow",
    "category": "Sequence",
    "description": "Copper at 96 BPM. CV 1 raises the echo send and feedback at the ends of a four-bar phrase. The Time movement changes the spacing of the repeats. Return lift controls how much the delay comes forward. Press Play seq.",
